+|--------|---------|
+| Add `[ANNOUNCE]` marker | `auto-reflect/src/AtmReflect.ts`, `auto-reflect/src/cli.ts`, `src/cli/index.ts`, `auto-reflect/README.md` |
+| Add `[SCHEDULE]` marker | Same as above |
+| Add `prompt-suggest` CLI | `src/cli/index.ts` ✅ |
